# Canonical contributor identities.
#
# Several of us have committed under more than one name or email address (a university
# address and a GitHub noreply one, or a display name that changed part-way through).
# Raw `git log` author names therefore split one person's work across several entries.
#
# This file maps every alias onto one canonical identity per person, so
# `git shortlog -sn`, `git log --author=...` and GitHub's contributor views all
# attribute work to the right person.
#
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email> Alias Name <alias@email>

